abstract: >-
  Open-source machine-learning network-flow detector that converts
  CICFlowMeter-compatible traffic into deterministic analyst-facing security
  incidents using causal temporal features, a frozen model, incident
  aggregation, and a versioned output contract.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - machine learning
  - network security
  - anomaly detection
  - intrusion detection
  - detection engineering
  - CICFlowMeter
  - security analytics
